1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,994
A primary standard must tick five boxes.

2
00:00:02,994 --> 00:00:06,796
Very pure, ninety nine point nine percent or better.

3
00:00:06,796 --> 00:00:15,716
Stable in air, so it neither absorbs moisture, nor loses its water of crystallisation, nor picks up carbon dioxide.

4
00:00:15,716 --> 00:00:19,179
Readily soluble, with a solution that keeps.

5
00:00:19,179 --> 00:00:20,781
A high equivalent weight.

6
00:00:20,781 --> 00:00:25,182
And a reaction that is fast, complete and stoichiometric.

